@startuml 时序图-检索与收藏
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor 学生 as Student
participant "ConsoleApp\n(迭代三为 MainFrame)" as UI
participant ItemService as IS
participant ItemDao as ID
participant FavoriteDao as FD
database "SQLite" as DB

== 条件检索 ==
Student -> UI : 输入关键词并选择排序方式
UI -> IS : search(SearchCriteria, ItemSorter)
IS -> ID : search(criteria)
ID -> ID : 动态拼接固定 SQL 片段 + 参数占位符
ID -> DB : SELECT ... FROM items WHERE status=? AND title LIKE ? ESCAPE '\\' ...
DB --> ID : 结果集
ID --> IS : List<Item>
IS -> IS : 应用排序策略（NEWEST / PRICE_ASC / PRICE_DESC / HOTTEST）
IS --> UI : 排序后的 List<Item>
UI --> Student : 表格展示

== 收藏 ==
Student -> UI : 点击收藏
UI -> IS : favorite(userId, itemId)
IS -> IS : 校验用户状态与物品是否在架
IS -> FD : add(userId, itemId)
FD -> DB : INSERT OR IGNORE INTO favorites ...
DB --> FD : 影响行数
FD --> IS : true（首次）/ false（已收藏）
IS --> UI : 收藏结果
UI --> Student : 提示收藏成功
@enduml
